"Opravdu chcete pokračovat?"

#. module: product_expiry
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_expiry/wizard/confirm_expiry.py:0
msgid ""
"You are going to deliver the product %(product_name)s, %(lot_name)s which is expired or should at least be removed from stock.\n"
"Do you confirm you want to proceed?"
msgstr ""
"Chystáte se vydat produkt %(product_name)s, %(lot_name)s, který má prošlou expiraci nebo by měl být alespoň vyskladněn.\n"
"Opravdu chcete pokračovat?"
